--- !u!114 &251583086
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 251583084}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 60e8d2a9973b39940be58894960f20e5, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 20
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 2
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 3
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "1. Connect Cables\r\n2. Insert DFM drives (as needed)\r\n3. Connect to
    CT0\r\n4. Insert USB Drive with OS package (Fat32 or NTFS)\r\n5. Connect to array
    via command line\r\n\r\nInitial Login:\r\n1. Login as 'puresetup'\r\n2. Use Password:
    embind anecdota praiser obelize\r\n\r\nCopying OS Package Files to Controller:\r\n1.
    ls /dev/sd*1\r\n2. mount /dev/sdb1 /mnt  (usually sdb1)\r\n3. cp /mnt/FOLDERNAME/*
    . (the period means current folder which is /home/puresetup)\r\n\r\nInstalling
    Purity on Controller:\r\n1. pureinstall /home/puresetup/{package-file-name}\r\n2.
    pureboot list (check which version of OS will run)\r\n3. pureboot reboot --offline\r\n4.
    Wait for Reboot.\r\n\r\nSetting Up Purity On Controller:\r\nPurity is now Installed,
    Firmware upgrades take some time.\r\n1. puresetup newarray  --skip-connectivity-tests\r\n2.
    Follow On-Screen Instructions\r\n\r\nConfigure Controller (Primary Config):\r\nARRAY
    NAME: \t      PURE_STORAGE\r\nPHYSICAL IP:\t      192.104.152.17\r\nVIRTUAL IP:
    \t      192.104.152.18\r\nNETMASK:\t      255.255.255.0\r\nGATEWAY:\t      192.104.152.1\r\nDNS
    SERVERS:\t      10.0.0.0\r\nDNS DOMAIN:\t      pstrg.net\r\nNTP SERVER:\t     
    ntp01.pstrg.net\r\nEMAIL RELAY/SMTP:     mail.pstrg.net\r\nEMAIL SENDER DOMAIN: 
    pstrg.net\r\nALERT RECIPIENTS:     Admin@pstrg.net\r\n\r\nSetting Time Zones:\r\n1.
    Choose Time Zone by entering the corresponding number.\r\n2. Enter to Reboot
    (applying all changes)\r\n3. Wait for Reboot and Login as 'pureeng' (cloudassist
    or C/R)\r\n4. Use as usual.\r\n\r\nRepeat the above steps on CT1."
